{"seq":1,"slug":"card-issue-purchase","title":"礼品卡发行、购买与激活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/gift-card-lifecycle/card-issue-purchase","wordCount":2216,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"礼品卡发行-购买与激活\">礼品卡发行、购买与激活</h1><p>礼品卡业务最反直觉的一点是：<strong>卡号通常在用户购买之前就已经存在了</strong>。一批卡在仓库里生成好，印在塑料片上或存进条码池，等着被抓取、被购买、被激活。这个「先有卡、后有钱」的顺序决定了一整套建模方式，也决定了购买流程为什么必须与激活流程分开。本文给出这条路径上的关键设计决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-卡是凭证-余额是账户\">核心概念：卡是凭证，余额是账户</h2><p>在写第一行代码之前必须回答一个问题：礼品卡在系统里是一行记录还是两行？常见有三种建模：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>建模方式</th>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>致命缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单行卡记录</td>\n<td><code>gift_card(id, face_value, remaining, status)</code></td>\n<td>简单，查询直接</td>\n<td>兑换后「钱去哪了」无法表达；退卡、转赠、过期接管全部无处挂载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡即余额账户</td>\n<td><code>account(id)</code>，卡是账户的别名</td>\n<td>兑换后处理顺畅</td>\n<td>未激活卡的账户语义混乱；一张卡只能一个人用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡是凭证 + 余额是账户</td>\n<td><code>gift_card</code> 与 <code>balance_account</code> 两个对象，兑换是一次转账</td>\n<td>语义干净，扩展性好</td>\n<td>需要处理「卡未兑换但已被用掉一部分」的中间态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本 hub 采用第三种。理由是：<strong>卡与余额的失效条件不同</strong>。卡的失效由卡自身的规则决定（未激活超期作废、被盗冻结、被转赠后原卡失效），余额的失效由账户规则决定（休眠、法规接管）。如果把两者压成一行，第 3 章的过期与残值规则会互相打架——一张卡过期了，但用户已经把它的钱兑换进余额并花掉了一半，此时「卡过期」到底意味着什么？</p>\n<p>用一个 mermaid 图看清三个对象的关系与状态迁移：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[卡号池: 已生成未售] --&gt;|抓取/下单| B[已发行: ISSUED]&#10;    B --&gt;|支付成功| C[已激活: ACTIVE]&#10;    B --&gt;|超期未售| Z1[作废: VOID]&#10;    C --&gt;|部分兑换| D[部分兑换: PARTIALLY_REDEEMED]&#10;    D --&gt;|余额耗尽| E[已核销: REDEEMED]&#10;    C --&gt;|全额兑换| E&#10;    C --&gt;|转赠| F[已转出: TRANSFERRED]&#10;    C --&gt;|冻结| G[冻结: FROZEN]&#10;    G --&gt;|申诉通过| C&#10;    E --&gt;|退款转入卡| D&#10;    D --&gt; H[(balance_account)]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I[新持卡人账号]\">graph TD\n    A[卡号池: 已生成未售] --&gt;|抓取/下单| B[已发行: ISSUED]\n    B --&gt;|支付成功| C[已激活: ACTIVE]\n    B --&gt;|超期未售| Z1[作废: VOID]\n    C --&gt;|部分兑换| D[部分兑换: PARTIALLY_REDEEMED]\n    D --&gt;|余额耗尽| E[已核销: REDEEMED]\n    C --&gt;|全额兑换| E\n    C --&gt;|转赠| F[已转出: TRANSFERRED]\n    C --&gt;|冻结| G[冻结: FROZEN]\n    G --&gt;|申诉通过| C\n    E --&gt;|退款转入卡| D\n    D --&gt; H[(balance_account)]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I[新持卡人账号]</pre><p>这里有两个容易忽略的状态。<strong><code>PARTIALLY_REDEEMED</code> 不是多余的状态</strong>：如果卡的价值被拆分兑换（例如面值 100，先兑换 30 到余额），系统必须记住还剩 70 没有兑换主体，否则第 3 章的残值计算会算错。<strong>退款转入卡</strong>回到 <code>PARTIALLY_REDEEMED</code> 而不是 <code>ACTIVE</code>，因为卡本身的有效期已经走了一段，把它当作全新激活的卡会错误地延长有效期。</p>\n<p><code>gift_card</code> 与 <code>balance_account</code> 的分界同时也划清了礼品卡与优惠券的界限。优惠券是营销费用，它在发放那一刻就被记入费用，抵扣订单时不产生负债，过期直接失效无人在意；礼品卡是负债，收到现金的同时欠下等值债务，过期与残值受法规约束。把礼品卡做成「一种特殊优惠券」是最常见的架构错误，它会在第 3 章的对账里彻底暴露——优惠券不需要对账，礼品卡需要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡号生成-pan-条码与卡密\">卡号生成：PAN、条码与卡密</h2><p>卡号有两条技术路线，它们的安全性模型完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>支付网络兼容型（PAN）</strong> 使用 16–19 位数字，符合 ISO/IEC 7812 的构成（发卡行识别号 + 账号 + Luhn 校验位）。这类卡号可以像银行卡一样在 POS 终端上刷卡或手输。它的代价是：一旦走卡组织网络，交易会按**无卡交易（card-not-present）**处理，商家要承担拒付责任，且必须遵守 PCI DSS 对卡数据的存储要求——即便礼品卡号不等于银行卡号，收单方常常仍要求等级保护。</p>\n<p><strong>自有条码/短码型</strong> 使用商家自有的编码（二维码、Code 128 条码、或 12–16 位自有短码）。它完全不经过卡组织，安全性由商家自己负责，兑换只发生在自有 App、门店 POS 或网站。绝大多数现代电商礼品卡走这条路。</p>\n<p>无论哪条路线，<strong>卡密（redeem code / PIN）与卡号必须是两个独立的秘密</strong>，不能由一个推导出另一个：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GiftCardIssuance {&#10;  cardId: string;&#10;  pan: string;&#10;  pinHash: string;&#10;  salt: string;&#10;  batchId: string;&#10;  faceValueMinor: number;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  issuedAt: Date;&#10;  activationDeadline: Date | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function generateBatch(pool: CardPool, size: number): GiftCardIssuance[] {&#10;  return Array.from({ length: size }, () =&gt; {&#10;    const pan = buildPan(pool.bin, secureRandom(pool.accountLength));&#10;    const pin = secureRandomString(pool.pinLength);&#10;    const salt = secureRandomString(16);&#10;    return {&#10;      cardId: ulid(),&#10;      pan,&#10;      pinHash: hmacSha256(pin, salt + pool.pepperRef),&#10;      salt,&#10;      batchId: pool.batchId,&#10;      faceValueMinor: pool.faceValueMinor,&#10;      currency: pool.currency,&#10;      issuedAt: new Date(),&#10;      activationDeadline: pool.activationDeadline,&#10;    };&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GiftCardIssuance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cardId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pinHash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  salt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  batchId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  faceValueMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  issuedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  activationDeadline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CardPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GiftCardIssuance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: size }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildPan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pool.bin, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">secureRandom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pool.accountLength));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> secureRandomString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pool.pinLength);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> salt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> secureRandomString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      cardId: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ulid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      pan,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      pinHash: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hmacSha256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pin, salt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool.pepperRef),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      salt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      batchId: pool.batchId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      faceValueMinor: pool.faceValueMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      currency: pool.currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      issuedAt: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      activationDeadline: pool.activationDeadline,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个细节决定了这套生成逻辑能不能扛住审计。<strong>随机数必须来自 CSPRNG</strong>，不能用 <code>Math.random()</code>——卡密是可枚举空间，伪随机等于没有。<strong>卡密只存哈希</strong>，与密码同等级别处理，具体方案见<a href=\"../aml-fraud/card-security-codes\">卡密安全与兑换幂等</a>。<strong>批量生成必须可审计</strong>：<code>batchId</code> 让运营能一次性冻结整批被怀疑泄露的卡，也让你在第 4 章的盗刷分析里能把「泄露批次」与「异常兑换模式」关联起来。</p>\n<p>卡号池的容量是需要提前规划的。如果卡号长度固定、必须过 Luhn 校验，可用空间大约是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 级别；再扣掉避免与真实银行卡 BIN 冲突的号段，一个电商自有的 16 位卡号空间通常足够，但<strong>短码空间（8–10 位）很容易在促销活动中被枚举攻击打穿</strong>，一旦池子里的可用卡号被猜中，攻击者可以直接猜未发行的卡号。这一点在第 4 章第 2 篇会展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"购买与激活为什么必须分开\">购买与激活为什么必须分开</h2><p>实体卡在货架上被拿走的那一刻，卡号已经在系统里了，但钱还没付。这就是为什么「购买」与「激活」是两次不同的动作。</p>\n<p><strong>发行（Issue）</strong> 只发生一次，发生在生成卡号池时。发行不代表卡可用。</p>\n<p><strong>购买（Purchase）</strong> 是用户用真实资金买下这张卡，通常发生在结账流程里。购买成功后系统做两件事：把卡与订单关联，并把卡标记为 <code>ACTIVE</code>——对数字卡而言，购买即激活。</p>\n<p><strong>激活（Activate）</strong> 对实体卡是一条独立的报文：POS 在结账时向发卡方发送 <code>ACTIVATION</code> 请求（在北美零售业这是标准流程，通常通过礼品卡处理网络完成），发卡方确认后才把卡置为 <code>ACTIVE</code>。未激活的卡在兑换接口上必须被拒绝。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type ActivateResult =&#10;  | { ok: true; cardId: string; activatedAt: Date }&#10;  | { ok: false; reason: &#39;NOT_FOUND&#39; | &#39;ALREADY_ACTIVE&#39; | &#39;VOID&#39; | &#39;EXPIRED_DEADLINE&#39; | &#39;FROZEN&#39; };&#10;&#10;async function activate(cardId: string, orderId: string, paidAmountMinor: number): Promise&lt;ActivateResult&gt; {&#10;  return db.transaction(async (tx) =&gt; {&#10;    const card = await tx.giftCards.lockForUpdate(cardId);&#10;    if (!card) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;NOT_FOUND&#39; };&#10;    if (card.status === &#39;ACTIVE&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;ALREADY_ACTIVE&#39; };&#10;    if (card.status === &#39;VOID&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;VOID&#39; };&#10;    if (card.status === &#39;FROZEN&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;FROZEN&#39; };&#10;    if (card.activationDeadline &amp;&amp; card.activationDeadline &lt; now()) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;EXPIRED_DEADLINE&#39; };&#10;&#10;    await tx.giftCards.update(cardId, { status: &#39;ACTIVE&#39;, activatedAt: now(), purchaseOrderId: orderId });&#10;    await tx.giftCardEvents.append({ cardId, type: &#39;ACTIVATED&#39;, orderId, paidAmountMinor, at: now() });&#10;    return { ok: true, cardId, activatedAt: now() };&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActivateResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cardId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">activatedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NOT_FOUND'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ALREADY_ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VOID'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXPIRED_DEADLINE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> activate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cardId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">paidAmountMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ActivateResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span cl