"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VOID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VOID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.activationDeadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> card.activationDeadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPIRED_DEADLINE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.giftCards.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cardId, { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, activatedAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), purchaseOrderId: orderId });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.giftCardEvents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ cardId, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, orderId, paidAmountMinor, at: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cardId, activatedAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>面值与实付金额可能不同</strong>，这是购买流程里最容易被忽略的一处。促销活动中「满 500 送 100 元礼品卡」时，实付 0 而面值 100；折扣渠道「95 折买 100 元卡」时，实付 95 而面值 100。系统必须同时记录 <code>faceValueMinor</code> 与 <code>paidAmountMinor</code>，因为第 3 章的储值负债对账要按<strong>实收现金</strong>记负债，而兑换时按<strong>面值</strong>扣减。两者之间的差额在财务上是营销费用或渠道折扣，不是负债。把这两个字段合并成一个，会让对账表永远平不了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"激活幂等与并发购买\">激活幂等与并发购买</h2><p>购买流程处在支付回调的路径上，而支付回调是至少一次投递的——同一个 <code>orderId</code> 的激活请求可能到达两次、三次，甚至乱序。<strong>激活必须是幂等的</strong>，且幂等键应该是 <code>orderId</code> 而不是请求 ID：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function activateIdempotent(orderId: string, cardId: string, paid: number): Promise&lt;ActivateResult&gt; {&#10;  const existing = await db.giftCardEvents.findByOrder(orderId, &#39;ACTIVATED&#39;);&#10;  if (existing) return { ok: true, cardId: existing.cardId, activatedAt: existing.at };&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    await db.giftCardEvents.insert(&#10;      { orderId, cardId, type: &#39;ACTIVATED&#39;, paid, at: now() },&#10;      { unique: [&#39;orderId&#39;, &#39;type&#39;] },&#10;    );&#10;    await db.giftCards.update(cardId, { status: &#39;ACTIVE&#39;, activatedAt: now() });&#10;    return { ok: true, cardId, activatedAt: now() };&#10;  } catch (e) {&#10;    if (isUniqueViolation(e)) {&#10;      const raced = await db.giftCardEvents.findByOrder(orderId, &#39;ACTIVATED&#39;);&#10;      return { ok: true, cardId: raced!.cardId, activatedAt: raced!.at };&#10;    }&#10;    throw e;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> activateIdempotent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cardId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">paid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ActivateResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.giftCardEvents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (existing) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cardId: existing.cardId, activatedAt: existing.at };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.giftCardEvents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { orderId, cardId, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, paid, at: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { unique: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orderId'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.giftCards.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cardId, { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, activatedAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cardId, activatedAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isUniqueViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> raced</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.giftCardEvents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cardId: raced</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cardId, activatedAt: raced</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.at };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里用<strong>唯一约束</strong>而不是「先查后写」来保证幂等。先查后写存在竞态：两个并发请求同时查到「没有记录」，然后都去写，结果是两次激活、两笔事件、卡被激活两次（如果后续有赠送逻辑就会双倍发出）。数据库唯一约束是唯一可靠的仲裁者——这也是本 hub 全部幂等契约的共同基础，参见<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">余额账户与只追加流水</a>里的同款模式。</p>\n<p>一个更隐蔽的并发场景：<strong>同一张卡被两个订单同时购买</strong>。实体卡被拿到两个收银台扫描、或者数字卡池的抓取逻辑有 bug 时都可能发生。防线是「卡在 <code>ISSUED</code> 状态下只能被一个订单占用」，通过把 <code>purchaseOrderId</code> 加唯一约束实现；第二个订单会拿到唯一冲突，此时业务上应该换发一张新卡，而不是让用户重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>卡是凭证、余额是账户</strong>，两者失效条件不同，必须分对象建模；把礼品卡做成「特殊优惠券」是架构级错误，它会在储值负债对账时暴露。</li>\n<li><strong>卡号先于购买存在</strong>，因此发行、购买、激活是三件事；实体卡的激活是一条独立的 POS 报文，未激活卡在兑换侧必须被拒。</li>\n<li><strong>卡号与卡密必须独立</strong>，卡密只存哈希（HMAC + salt + pepper），随机数必须来自 CSPRNG，批量生成必须带 <code>batchId</code> 以便整批冻结。</li>\n<li><strong>面值与实付金额必须分开记</strong>——负债按实收现金计，兑换按面值扣，差额是营销费用或渠道折扣。</li>\n<li><strong>激活幂等键是 <code>orderId</code></strong>，靠数据库唯一约束仲裁，而不是先查后写；并发购买同一张卡的防线是 <code>purchaseOrderId</code> 唯一约束 + 换发新卡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>卡被激活之后，下一步是它被用掉——钱如何从卡进入余额账户，见<a href=\"card-redeem-balance\">兑换入账到储值余额</a>；卡在人与人之间流转时的所有权问题，见<a href=\"card-transfer-gift\">礼品卡转赠与受赠</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"礼品卡发行、购买与激活","id":"礼品卡发行-购买与激活"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：卡是凭证，余额是账户","id":"核心概念-卡是凭证-余额是账户"},{"level":2,"text":"卡号生成：PAN、条码与卡密","id":"卡号生成-pan-条码与卡密"},{"level":2,"text":"购买与激活为什么必须分开","id":"购买与激活为什么必须分开"},{"level":2,"text":"激活幂等与并发购买","id":"激活幂等与并发购买"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"兑换入账到储值余额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/gift-card-lifecycle/card-redeem-balance"}}